    "tips": [
      "Use a photo with a neutral expression - AI will transform it to match each emotion",
      "Context image helps ground the thumbnail in your video's topic",
      "Each emotion targets different psychological triggers for clicks",
      "Test multiple versions to see which performs best with your audience",
      "Shock & Curiosity typically have highest CTR for educational content",
      "Excitement works best for entertainment and lifestyle content",
      "Controversy is powerful but use carefully to maintain brand trust"
    ],
    "psychologyNotes": {
      "shock": "Triggers immediate attention through surprise and novelty",
      "curiosity": "Creates information gap that viewers want to close",
